## 4. RHBK v26: Hostname Must Be Full HTTPS URL

**Symptom:** Keycloak pod enters `CrashLoopBackOff` with
`IllegalArgumentException: Provided hostname-admin is not a valid URL`.

**Root Cause:** RHBK v26 (Keycloak 26+) changed the hostname spec to
require full URLs instead of bare hostnames.

**Fix:** Patch the Keycloak CR:

```bash
# WRONG (bare hostname — worked in v24, fails in v26)
hostname:
  hostname: keycloak-keycloak.apps.sno.karmalabs.corp

# CORRECT (full HTTPS URL)
hostname:
  hostname: https://keycloak-keycloak.apps.sno.karmalabs.corp
  admin: https://keycloak-keycloak.apps.sno.karmalabs.corp
```

**Rule:** Always use `https://` prefix in Keycloak hostname configuration
when deploying RHBK v26+.

